    <string name="usenet_notice_title">Built-in Usenet</string>
    <string name="usenet_notice_body">Nuvio connects to your indexers and Usenet providers directly from this device, with your own accounts. Nothing goes through a Nuvio or shared server.\n\n• Your indexers and providers see this device’s IP address, like any other app you use.\n• API keys and logins stay on this device, in this profile.\n• Every search uses API hits on each enabled indexer. For indexers with low limits, give them a lower priority and turn on Search lower priorities only as fallback.\n• Each indexer and provider still applies its own rules and limits.</string>
