    <string name="usenet_ranking_values_hint">Use comma-separated values for Is / Is not. Quality: REMUX, BLURAY, WEB_DL, WEBRIP, HDTV, DVD, CAM, UNKNOWN. Codec: HEVC, AVC, AV1, UNKNOWN. Visual: HDR, DV, HDR_DV, DV_ONLY, HDR10_PLUS, SDR, NO_HDR_LABEL. NO_HDR_LABEL means no HDR or Dolby Vision label was found. Regex supports case-insensitive regular expressions without lookaround or backreferences.</string>
