    <string name="usenet_provider_tune">Tune connections</string>
    <string name="usenet_provider_tune_description">Finds the connection limit, port and connection allowance that work best on this network.</string>
    <string name="usenet_provider_tune_data_warning">Uses a lot of data: often more than 1 GB, and up to about 4 GB on a fast line. It counts against a block account and, on mobile data, against your plan.</string>
    <string name="usenet_provider_tune_title">Tune %1$s</string>
    <string name="usenet_provider_tune_intro">Checks how many connections the account accepts, then measures the download speed on the provider’s ports and with more and more connections. It takes about two minutes. Keep the app open and do not play anything meanwhile. Other devices using this account at the same time lower the limit found. Nothing is saved until you apply the result.</string>
